  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4204.06 Protested Checks. The bureau shall pursue protested checks in accordance with the procedures set forth in Saf-C 304.07.\n\nSource. #7348, eff 8-22-00, EXPIRED: 8-22-08\n\nNew. #9375, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10025, eff 11-16-11, EXPIRED: 11-16-19\n\nNew. #13019, eff 4-7-20",
